#: ../../source/docs/common-xacti-gimbal.rst:7
#: 714211d088a447cb8a13e99205488418
msgid "The `Xacti Camera Gimbals <https://xacti-co.com/solution/drone/ardupilot/>`__ are relatively lightweight 3-axis camera gimbals which communicate with ArduPilot using the DroneCAN protocol.  Real time video output is available simultaneously through HDMI and USB.  Pictures taken include the vehicle's location (lat, lon, alt) stored using EXIF."
msgstr ""

